<div class="pt-12">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pb-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-terracotta-600 text-base font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-3xl leading-8 font-extrabold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-neutral-100">Short version: nothing leaves this instance.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-lg leading-8 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">
      <p>This <%= Instance.name %> instance is self-hosted. Your account, shots, coffee bags and images are stored in the database and on the storage that the instance operator runs.</p>
      <p>There is no third-party analytics, no advertising, no cloud sync and no telemetry. The only outbound requests are the ones you trigger yourself, such as fetching details for a coffee bag link.</p>
      <p>Removing your account removes your data; shots are kept without an owner only if an administrator deletes you from the admin area.</p>
      <p>Questions go to whoever runs this instance.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
